              }
            ],
            "text": "tapioca dough "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "filled with pork and prawn. "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "They come from "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "hue-cuisine"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "Huế cuisine "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "and turn beautifully translucent when steamed. "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This recipe serves 4."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The dough must be made with boiling water and used while still warm. It becomes stiff and hard to work with once it cools."
          }
        ]
      },
